<title>FRANCE: Morocco bought 10,000 T French soft wheat-trader.</title>
<headline>Morocco bought 10,000 T French soft wheat-trader.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco on Friday bought 10,000 tonnes of French soft wheat for December 1-10 delivery, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The wheat was priced at $173 per tonne, including cost and freight and a Coface-guaranteed export credit, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
